<p>
  SimplyBike allows users to permanently delete their account and associated data directly from within the app.
</p>

<h2>How to delete your account</h2>
<p>
  1. Open SimplyBike<br>
  2. Go to Settings<br>
  3. Select "Delete Account"<br>
  4. Confirm deletion
</p>

<h2>What data is deleted</h2>
<p>
  When an account is deleted, the following data is permanently removed:
  <br><br>
  • User account information<br>
  • Ride history<br>
  • Saved rides<br>
  • Equipment profiles<br>
  • App preferences associated with the account
</p>

<h2>Data retention</h2>
<p>
  Account deletion is intended to permanently remove user data from SimplyBike systems. Some limited backup copies may persist temporarily for operational and security purposes before being automatically removed.
</p>

<h2>Need help?</h2>
<p>
  If you experience problems deleting your account, please contact:
  <br><br>
  support@sprk42.com
</p>
